        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/marrakesh/_scene_python.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository c0e22262-d090-43e9-b65b-d5c83722386c).Image",
        "Description": "It&apos;s been three months since &apos;Ula Ikram Boutros and her friends drank alcohol, being clean ever since.\r\rIt&apos;s also been three months ever since their friend, Nimah Shahid, passed away in a fire when the whole group drank inside of the abandoned school.\r\rEver since, they have been occupying their minds and ignoring their drinking habits. However, Shahid&apos;s brother wants them to remember every aching second they left Nimah writhing in pain.\r\rBreak their dry spell.",
